        {"item_id": "A2_item_001", "category": "research_object", "evidence_quote": "本文研究 hidden-total closed-world discovery 中的错误停止问题。", "source_path": "E:\\learn3\\B\\new\\2\\思路.md", "source_family": "local_markdown", "search_route": "focused_theory_read"},
        {"item_id": "A2_item_002", "category": "research_object", "evidence_quote": "多 Agent discovery 什么时候错误停止？", "source_path": "E:\\learn3\\B\\new\\2\\思路.md", "source_family": "local_markdown", "search_route": "focused_theory_read"},
        {"item_id": "A2_item_003", "category": "theory", "evidence_quote": "不要把几何理解成 embedding 空间或 Grassmann 流形；你们的问题更适合做 **覆盖分布在 simplex 上的几何**，核心不是“Agent 输出像不像”，而是“搜索努力是否在全局空间上形成了足够均匀的反证覆盖”。", "source_path": "E:\\learn3\\B\\new\\2\\思路.md", "source_family": "local_markdown", "search_route": "focused_theory_read"},
        {"item_id": "A2_item_004", "category": "theory", "evidence_quote": "**exposure / search effort 集中导致 no-new-item 只能证明局部耗尽，不能证明全局完成。**", "source_path": "E:\\learn3\\B\\new\\2\\思路.md", "source_family": "local_markdown", "search_route": "focused_theory_read"},
        {"item_id": "A2_item_005", "category": "theory", "evidence_quote": "**False completion is local exhaustion under localized exposure.** 错误完成是局部搜索耗尽被误认为全局完成。", "source_path": "E:\\learn3\\B\\new\\2\\思路.md", "source_family": "local_markdown", "search_route": "focused_theory_read"},
        {"item_id": "A2_item_006", "category": "theory", "evidence_quote": "几何对象：搜索努力在 source-route simplex 上的分布", "source_path": "E:\\learn3\\B\\new\\2\\思路.md", "source_family": "local_markdown", "search_route": "focused_theory_read"},
        {"item_id": "A2_item_007", "category": "theory", "evidence_quote": "每次工作流运行到第 $t$ 轮，搜索努力分布就是 simplex 上的一个点", "source_path": "E:\\learn3\\B\\new\\2\\思路.md", "source_family": "local_markdown", "search_route": "focused_theory_read"},
        {"item_id": "A2_item_008", "category": "theory", "evidence_quote": "Gini、entropy、max-stratum mass、Lorenz curve 都是描述这个点是否靠近边界的量。", "source_path": "E:\\learn3\\B\\new\\2\\思路.md", "source_family": "local_markdown", "search_route": "focused_theory_read"},
        {"item_id": "A2_item_009", "category": "theory", "evidence_quote": "在固定预算下，搜索暴露越局部化，no-new-item stopping 后的 worst-case 或 expected residual missing mass 越高。", "source_path": "E:\\learn3\\B\\new\\2\\思路.md", "source_family": "local_markdown", "search_route": "focused_theory_read"},
        {"item_id": "A2_item_010", "category": "method", "evidence_quote": "方法：低覆盖区域 residual challenger", "source_path": "E:\\learn3\\B\\new\\2\\思路.md", "source_family": "local_markdown", "search_route": "focused_theory_read"},
        {"item_id": "A2_item_011", "category": "method", "evidence_quote": "Gini 本身只能诊断风险；low-coverage challenger 能证明这个风险有实际位置。", "source_path": "E:\\learn3\\B\\new\\2\\思路.md", "source_family": "local_markdown", "search_route": "focused_theory_read"},
        {"item_id": "A2_item_012", "category": "method", "evidence_quote": "一个由理论自然导出的 low-coverage residual challenger 能在低覆盖区域恢复遗漏条目，并降低错误停止。", "source_path": "E:\\learn3\\B\\new\\2\\思路.md", "source_family": "local_markdown", "search_route": "focused_theory_read"},
