        {"item_id": "A2_item_014", "category": "method", "evidence_quote": "低暴露区域 Challenger 能有效检验并恢复残余遗漏。", "source_path": "E:\\learn3\\B\\new\\2\\思路.md", "source_family": "local_markdown", "search_route": "focused_theory_read"}
