        {"item_id": "A3-I02", "category": "false_completion", "evidence_quote": "“漏项”并不是一个统一问题。有些证据已经出现但被聚合器丢掉；另一些证据从未进入候选池。", "source_path": "E:\\learn3\\B\\new\\2\\ChatGPT-研究准备与虚假收敛.md", "source_family": "local_markdown", "search_route": "keyword_geometry_scan"},
        {"item_id": "A3-I03", "category": "coverage_geometry", "evidence_quote": "所有 Agent 都使用相似的搜索策略，重复覆盖容易发现的区域，同时漏掉相同的困难区域。即使将所有输出直接取并集，仍然无法恢复遗漏项。", "source_path": "E:\\learn3\\B\\new\\2\\ChatGPT-研究准备与虚假收敛.md", "source_family": "local_markdown", "search_route": "keyword_geometry_scan"},
        {"item_id": "A3-I04", "category": "coverage_geometry", "evidence_quote": "第一版不需要做得过重，先采用：source family × search route", "source_path": "E:\\learn3\\B\\new\\2\\ChatGPT-研究准备与虚假收敛.md", "source_family": "local_markdown", "search_route": "keyword_geometry_scan"},
        {"item_id": "A3-I05", "category": "method", "evidence_quote": "DICE-Lite：Decorrelated Independent Coverage Estimation / 去相关独立覆盖估计方法", "source_path": "E:\\learn3\\B\\new\\2\\ChatGPT-研究准备与虚假收敛.md", "source_family": "local_markdown", "search_route": "keyword_geometry_scan"},
        {"item_id": "A3-I06", "category": "method", "evidence_quote": "它的核心不是“增加更多 Agent”，而是：主动制造、测量并利用去相关探索，让 completion 变成一个可以实验验证的覆盖问题。", "source_path": "E:\\learn3\\B\\new\\2\\ChatGPT-研究准备与虚假收敛.md", "source_family": "local_markdown", "search_route": "keyword_geometry_scan"},
        {"item_id": "A3-I07", "category": "method", "evidence_quote": "We do not merely ensemble agents; we intervene on their exploration distributions.", "source_path": "E:\\learn3\\B\\new\\2\\ChatGPT-研究准备与虚假收敛.md", "source_family": "local_markdown", "search_route": "keyword_geometry_scan"},
        {"item_id": "A3-I08", "category": "safe_stopping", "evidence_quote": "停止条件不应只看 Agent 数量、表面 overlap 或连续无新增轮数，而应考察每个关键区域是否获得足够独立的覆盖证据。", "source_path": "E:\\learn3\\B\\new\\2\\ChatGPT-研究准备与虚假收敛.md", "source_family": "local_markdown", "search_route": "keyword_geometry_scan"},
        {"item_id": "A3-I09", "category": "safe_stopping", "evidence_quote": "DICE-Lite 通过主动制造互补探索，并依据分层残余风险证据判断多智能体发现工作流是否可以安全停止。", "source_path": "E:\\learn3\\B\\new\\2\\ChatGPT-研究准备与虚假收敛.md", "source_family": "local_markdown", "search_route": "keyword_geometry_scan"},
        {"item_id": "A3-I10", "category": "safe_stopping", "evidence_quote": "一致性、多样性和候选核验都不足以证明高召回发现任务已经完成。真正缺失的是相关探索条件下可审计的安全停止机制。", "source_path": "E:\\learn3\\B\\new\\2\\ChatGPT-研究准备与虚假收敛.md", "source_family": "local_markdown", "search_route": "keyword_geometry_scan"},
        {"item_id": "A3-I11", "category": "false_completion", "evidence_quote": "在有范围约束的集合发现任务中，工作流根据表面一致性、低新增率或自报完成度停止，但最终集合仍低于目标召回阈值。", "source_path": "E:\\learn3\\B\\new\\2\\ChatGPT-研究准备与虚假收敛.md", "source_family": "local_markdown", "search_route": "keyword_geometry_scan"},
        {"item_id": "A3-I12", "category": "method", "evidence_quote": "在动态、高召回集合发现任务中，仅有多样化 Agent 仍不足以支持停止；只有将主动去相关探索与分层残余风险评估结合，才能在控制审查成本的同时降低错误认证率。", "source_path": "E:\\learn3\\B\\new\\2\\ChatGPT-研究准备与虚假收敛.md", "source_family": "local_markdown", "search_route": "keyword_geometry_scan"}
